### Lab 1 smoke tests — open in VS / VS Code (REST Client) / Rider
@base = http://localhost:5100
@tenant = clinic-haddad

### Tenants (find the tenantId)
GET {{base}}/tenants

### Doctors
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{tenant}}/doctors

### Free slots for Dr. Haddad (pick a weekday in the future)
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{tenant}}/doctors/1/slots?date=2026-10-19

### Book (copy a startsAt value exactly from the slots response)
POST {{base}}/tenants/{{tenant}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "startsAt": "2026-10-19T09:00:00+03:00",
  "patientPhone": "96170123456",
  "patientName": "Maya Test",
  "reason": "Routine check-up"
}

### Same slot, other patient → expect 422 slot_not_available (already booked).
# A 409 slot_taken only appears in a true race: two requests passing validation at the same instant.
POST {{base}}/tenants/{{tenant}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "startsAt": "2026-10-19T09:00:00+03:00",
  "patientPhone": "96171999888",
  "patientName": "Other Patient",
  "reason": null
}

### Upcoming appointments for a phone
GET {{base}}/tenants/{{tenant}}/appointments?phone=96170123456
